coalition-of-planets/allen-the-alien\" class=\"entity-link\">Allen the Alien</a>\n            — Allen serves the Coalition.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Opposes:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/invincible/sequids\" class=\"entity-link\">Sequids</a>\n            — <a href=\"/invincible/sequids\" class=\"entity-link\">Sequids</a> threaten Coalition worlds.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/invincible/viltrum/viltrumite-empire/thragg\" class=\"entity-link\">Thragg</a>\n            — Coalition of Planets is connected to <a href=\"/invincible/viltrum/viltrumite-empire/thragg\" class=\"entity-link\">Thragg</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/invincible/viltrumites/mark-grayson\" class=\"entity-link\">Mark Grayson</a>\n            — Coalition of Planets is connected to <a href=\"/invincible/viltrumites/mark-grayson\" class=\"entity-link\">Mark Grayson</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/invincible/viltrumites\" class=\"entity-link\">Viltrumites</a>\n            — Coalition of Planets is connected to <a href=\"/invincible/viltrumites\" class=\"entity-link\">Viltrumites</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/invincible/viltrum/viltrumite-empire/conquest\" class=\"entity-link\">Conquest</a>\n            — Coalition of Planets is connected to <a href=\"/invincible/viltrum/viltrumite-empire/conquest\" class=\"entity-link\">Conquest</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"graph-section\">\n    <h2>Mapped connections</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"section-intro\">\n        Every edge is another route through the subject. Expand a group\n        to see how these threads fit together.\n    </p>\n\n    \n<section